<Layout
	title="About"
	description="A bit about Declan Curran."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		Hi &mdash; I'm Declan. I'm finishing a research Master's in Computer Science focused on
		<strong>climate downscaling</strong>: using machine learning to take coarse global climate
		model output and turn it into the kind of fine-grained, locally useful predictions you can
		actually plan around.
	</p>

	<p>
		Outside the research I love helping businesses solve problems with data &mdash; the messier
		and more cross-disciplinary the better. I'm especially drawn to <strong>healthtech</strong>,
		<strong>climate</strong>, <strong>economics</strong>, and anything sitting at the boundary
		of <strong>AI, science, and human behaviour</strong>. I also enjoy learning languages, mostly
		for the same reason: they're a way of seeing how someone else carved up the world.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I'm not at a screen I'm usually outside with a camera. I write
		<a href="/blog">sci-fi short stories</a>, shoot <a href="/photos">landscape and night-sky
		photography</a>, and travel as much as work allows.
	</p>

